---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const ld = [];
---
<Layout title="DsignPoint | Strategic growth partner for businesses ready for what's next" description="DsignPoint is a strategic growth partner for businesses that have outgrown their brand. We diagnose what needs to change, then help you make it happen." path="/" ogImage="/og-default.jpg"  preload="uploads/hero-bg.webp" jsonld={ld}>


<div style="position:relative;overflow-x:hidden;">


  <!-- HERO: full-screen photographic moment -->
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);overflow:hidden;--s1:oklch(30% 0.04 20);--s2:oklch(20% 0.03 20);">
    <img src="./uploads/hero-bg.webp" alt="A founder looking out over the city, reflecting on how far the business has come" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transform-origin:center;" class="hero-zoom">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, oklch(15% 0.05 20 / 0.35) 0%, oklch(15% 0.05 20 / 0.15) 40%, oklch(12% 0.06 18 / 0.92) 100%);"></div>

    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px clamp(20px,5vw,56px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <a href="./" class="dp-logo" aria-label="DsignPoint home"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><img src="./uploads/DP-icon-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="" style="height:48px;width:auto;display:block;"><img src="./uploads/DP-wordmark-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="DsignPoint" style="height:24px;width:auto;display:block;"></span></a>
      <button type="button" class="dp-burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="dp-nav"><span></span><span></span></button><div id="dp-nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Main" class="dp-nav-links" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(14px,2vw,30px);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">
        <a href="./" aria-current="page" style="color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);padding-bottom:3px;">Home</a>
        <a href="approach/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Approach</a>
        <a href="case-studies/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Case Studies</a>
        <a href="insights/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Insights</a>
        <a href="about/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">About</a>
        <a href="book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);background:oklch(83% 0.05 80);color:oklch(24% 0.11 15);padding:12px 24px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 8px 28px oklch(83% 0.05 80 / 0.35);transition:background 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h1">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,56px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <h1 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(31px,5.3vw,80px);line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 32px;max-width:16ch;">
        Your business needs<br>
        <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">a glow up.</span>
      </h1>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:clamp(20px,3vw,48px);align-items:end;">
        <p style="font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,18px);line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:oklch(92% 0.015 50);max-width:40ch;">
          You've been in business for a while. You've built something real, you've had your successes, and you know there's more potential there. But lately, it feels like you're stuck.<br><br>Maybe you need a fresh direction. A stronger brand. A better website. A new way to reach your customers. Or maybe you just need someone to look at the whole picture and figure out what's next.<br><br>That's what we do.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-self:end;">
          <a href="book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);padding:17px 36px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;transition:background 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h2">Let's talk <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE TENSION: big image band, typographic cascade, burgundy close -->
  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;position:relative;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);overflow:hidden;" class="rv">

    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(72px,11vh,130px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px) 0;">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4.9vw,73px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;max-width:14ch;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,52px);">
        Sometimes your business just feels stuck.
      </h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;color:oklch(40% 0.01 30 / 0.75);max-width:44ch;">You have clients. You have experience. You've built a reputation.</p>
          <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-width:44ch;">But growth has slowed down. Things feel repetitive. And you're starting to wonder what could take the business to the next level.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;">
          <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./uploads/section2-bg.webp" alt="Colleagues discussing strategy over laptops" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(0.85);">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(72px,12vh,130px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);">
      <p style="font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);margin:0 0 clamp(32px,6vh,64px);">You might be here because…</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,33px);line-height:1.14;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,56px) 0;max-width:24ch;">Your business has been doing well, but it feels like you've reached a ceiling.</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,33px);line-height:1.14;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,56px) 32%;max-width:24ch;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">You're doing the same things you've always done, but they're not bringing the same results.</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,33px);line-height:1.14;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,56px) 8%;max-width:24ch;">Your brand doesn't feel as exciting or relevant as it once did.</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,33px);line-height:1.14;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,56px) 40%;max-width:26ch;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">Your website and marketing no longer give you the confidence you want when you send people there.</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,33px);line-height:1.14;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,56px) 4%;max-width:24ch;">You've got ideas for what's next, but you don't know which direction to take.</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,33px);line-height:1.14;margin:0 0 0 28%;max-width:22ch;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);">You know something needs to change, but you don't know what.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(72px,14vh,160px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 90% at 15% 0%, oklch(38% 0.15 17 / 0.9) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 90% 100%, oklch(13% 0.07 15 / 0.95) 0%, transparent 65%), oklch(24% 0.11 15);">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./uploads/DP-icon-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;right:-6%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);height:150%;width:auto;opacity:0.07;pointer-events:none;">
      <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27220%27%20height%3D%27220%27%3E%3Cfilter%20id%3D%27n%27%3E%3CfeTurbulence%20type%3D%27fractalNoise%27%20baseFrequency%3D%270.85%27%20numOctaves%3D%273%27%20stitchTiles%3D%27stitch%27%2F%3E%3CfeColorMatrix%20values%3D%270%200%200%200%201%20%200%200%200%200%201%20%200%200%200%200%201%20%200%200%200%200.6%200%27%2F%3E%3C%2Ffilter%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27100%25%27%20height%3D%27100%25%27%20filter%3D%27url%28%23n%29%27%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E);opacity:0.09;mix-blend-mode:soft-light;pointer-events:none;"></div>
      <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 50%, transparent 40%, oklch(10% 0.06 15 / 0.55) 100%);pointer-events:none;"></div>
      <p style="position:relative;font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(24px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1.2;margin:0 auto;text-wrap:balance;">
        <span style="display:block;">You don't need to start over.</span><span style="display:block;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">You might just need a glow up.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- POINT OF VIEW: oversized typographic moment -->
  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);padding:clamp(96px,18vh,200px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(29px,6vw,72px);line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.015em;margin:0 0 clamp(56px,10vh,110px);">
        We don't start with your brand.<br>
        <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(38% 0.15 17);">We start with your business.</span>
      </h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:end;">
        <div style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.1vw,29px);line-height:1.15;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px;color:oklch(35% 0.01 30);">A new website might be the answer.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px 6%;color:oklch(35% 0.01 30);">A new identity might be the answer.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px 12%;color:oklch(35% 0.01 30);">A new positioning might be the answer.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 0 18%;font-style:italic;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);">Or none of them might be.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.4vw,18px);line-height:1.65;color:oklch(28% 0.01 30);max-width:46ch;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">We don't believe in prescribing the same solution to every business. We first understand where you are, where you want to go and what's standing between the two.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 36px;font-weight:500;">Because the right solution starts with the right question.</p>
          <a href="book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:oklch(33% 0.14 17);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:17px 36px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;transition:background 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h3">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DIRECTION -> EXECUTION: two full-bleed panels, mono to colour -->
  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(64px,12vh,120px) 0 0;" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4.9vw,72px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(40px,8vh,80px);">Direction first.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(38% 0.15 17);">Execution second.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(340px,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);align-items:start;width:min(1200px, calc(100% - 2*clamp(20px,5vw,56px)));margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="position:relative;min-height:clamp(460px,70vh,700px);overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./uploads/section4-direction.webp" alt="A designer reviewing a mood board of direction and positioning references" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(0.6) contrast(1.05);">
        <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 25%, oklch(15% 0.02 20 / 0.88) 100%);"></div>
        <div style="position:relative;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">
          <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(95% 0.01 40 / 0.85);margin:0 0 14px;">Direction</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,32px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 20px;">We step back before moving forward.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-width:40ch;color:oklch(92% 0.015 50);">We look at your business, positioning, offer, audience, brand and ambitions to understand what needs to evolve — and why.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="position:relative;min-height:clamp(460px,70vh,700px);overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:clamp(0px,6vw,88px);">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./uploads/section4-execution.webp" alt="A hand sketching on a tablet against a moodboard of brand references" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
        <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 25%, oklch(12% 0.06 18 / 0.9) 100%);"></div>
        <div style="position:relative;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">
          <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 14px;">Execution</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,32px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 20px;">We turn direction into something tangible.</p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-width:40ch;color:oklch(92% 0.015 50);">Strategy, messaging, identity, website, digital presence, marketing — whatever the business actually needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(56px,10vh,110px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);align-items:end;">
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,1.9vw,25px);line-height:1.2;margin:0;max-width:26ch;">No unnecessary reinvention. No designing for the sake of designing. Just the right things, built for where you're going.</p>
      <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(18px,1.8vw,24px);color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);margin:0;justify-self:end;text-align:right;">Every business reflects the clarity of its founder.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES: capabilities beside a contained photograph -->
  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(24% 0.11 15);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(96px,16vh,180px) 0;" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:clamp(40px,7vw,104px);align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4.7vw,67px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(40px,7vh,72px);max-width:12ch;">From direction to reality.</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vh,52px) clamp(24px,3vw,40px);margin-bottom:clamp(48px,8vh,80px);">
          <div><h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">Direction</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Positioning</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Brand strategy</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Messaging</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Offer clarity</p></div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">Brand &amp; Identity</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Visual identity</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Brand systems</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Naming</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Brand evolution</p></div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">Digital Presence</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Websites</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">E-commerce</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">UX/UI</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Digital experiences</p></div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">Growth</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">SEO</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Digital marketing</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Content &amp; social media</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;color:oklch(93% 0.015 50);">Automation &amp; AI</p></div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);margin:0 0 32px;max-width:26ch;line-height:1.25;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">
          You don't have to know exactly what you need before you come to us.
        </p>
        <a href="book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:16px 32px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;transition:background 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h4">Book your call now <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./uploads/section5-bg-e3680b7b.webp" alt="A woman in a dark suit walking up a monumental staircase toward the light" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SELECTED WORK: one photo per project -->
  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(64px,12vh,120px) 0 clamp(64px,10vh,110px);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(25px,4.3vw,61px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(40px,8vh,80px);max-width:14ch;">Businesses we've helped move forward.</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="position:relative;min-height:clamp(440px,70vh,680px);overflow:hidden;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;width:min(1200px, calc(100% - 2*clamp(20px,5vw,56px)));margin:0 auto;">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./uploads/section6-jd-assist-bg.webp" alt="A trainer presenting real call scenarios to a training team, part of the JD Assist rebrand" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
      <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:oklch(12% 0.06 18 / 0.45);"></div><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 30%, oklch(12% 0.06 18 / 0.92) 100%);"></div>
